    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27105" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῑνωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned, rounded,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχη, κλισίη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.391
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.56
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥινοῖσι βοῶν καὶ νώροπι χαλκῷ
				δινωτήν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδα</span>) <i>covered with . . circular plates</i> (or
				<i>adorned with spirals</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.407
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>whirling,</i>
			
