					Parm.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτέρυγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epic.Alex.Adesp.</u>
					4.14
				</span></i>
			 Pap.</div>
